<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n15739" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">ē-nāvĭgo</span></b> ,
			āvi, ātum, 1, v. n.
		and <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<i>a.</i>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<i>Neutr.</i>, <i>to sail out</i>, <i>sail away.</i>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>A.</b>
			<b>Lit.</b>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">de ea civitate,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Dig. 45, 1, 122</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Rhodum,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Suet. Tib. 11</span></i>
			.—<b>
				<i>Absol.</i>
			</b>, <i><span class="en">Curt. 9, 9, 13</span></i>.—*
			</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>B.</b>
			<b>Trop.</b>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">tamquam e scrupulosis cotibus enavigavit
					oratio,</span>”
				<i>has escaped from</i>,
				 <i><span class="en">Cic.
					Tusc. 4, 14, 33</span></i>
			.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<i>Act.</i>, <i>to traverse by
			sailing</i>, <i>to sail over</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">undam,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Hor.
					C. 2, 14, 11</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">sinum,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Plin. 9,
					3, 2, § 6</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">(Indum),</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id. 6,
					17, 21, § 60</span></i>
			.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
